<title>UK: Moody's to issue BT/MCI statement.</title>
<headline>Moody's to issue BT/MCI statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Monday it would issue an annoucement concerning the rating implications of the merger between British Telecommunciations Plc and MCI Communciations Corp shortly.</p>
<p>&quot;We are in the process of completing a public announcement,&quot; Carlos Winzer, Moody's analyst told Reuters. &quot;It's going to be coming out within the next fifteen minutes or half an hour.  </p>
<p>British Telecom and MCI announced on Sunday they were set to merge.</p>
<p>Winzer said Moody's rates BT's senior unsecured debt AAA and MCI's senior unsecured debt A2.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
</text>
